rathon of minigames - after each round, vote on the next game. Collect the most money cases and claim the win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re just getting started: <strong>GG-Party</strong> is constantly growing. New modes, new minigames, new features - the fun never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Gather your friends, grab a controller, and show us what you’ve got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Insider:</strong><br>Our artists are designing unique characters and levels - no asset flips, just pure originality. GG-Party will be a treat for the eyes and your funny bone. Let’s go!</p>", "short_description": "Dive into the wild open-world party game for up to 8 players! Explore the island, crush quests for big cash, grab properties and shops, and pull sneaky pranks on your friends. The first to become a millionaire wins the game!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796340/d6485e13eb635d1b230f566ecfdefc6122c10e31/header.jpg?t=1779662029", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796340/d676fdefc777634a05fca28d359212ecab9895f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779662029", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796340/d676fdefc777634a05fca28d359212ecab9895f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779662029", "website": "https://gora.games", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7700 or Ryzen 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080 or AMD Radeon VII<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><st